## Testing

### Test Coverage Requirements
- **All logic must have unit test coverage**
- Do not remove existing tests; expand coverage as new logic is added
- Test status:
  - Unit tests: 56 passing total
    - 12 admin-dashboard-api
    - 35 bin-status-reporter
    - 9 lambda-authorizer
  - E2E tests: Require LocalStack running with `API_ENDPOINT` env var

### Test Types
- **Unit Tests:** Rust service tests (`cargo test`)
- **Integration Tests:** DynamoDB repository tests
- **Smoke Tests:** Quick validation after deployment (API, Lambda, DynamoDB)
- **E2E Tests:** Full API → SQS → Lambda → DynamoDB flow

### Running Tests
```bash
# Unit tests
cd services && cargo test

# E2E tests (requires LocalStack running)
./scripts/run-e2e-tests.sh

# Smoke tests
./scripts/smoke-test.sh local   # LocalStack
./scripts/smoke-test.sh dev     # AWS dev environment
```

---

## Development Workflow

### Local Development (LocalStack)
```bash
# Start LocalStack and deploy infrastructure
make local-up

# Run all tests (unit and E2E)
make test

# Run E2E tests only
make test-e2e

# Build Lambda function
./scripts/build-lambda.sh

# Deploy single layer
./infrastructure/scripts/deploy-layer.sh 03-api local

# Tear down the local environment
make reset-local
```

### Building Lambda Functions
```bash
# Build for AWS/LocalStack (x86_64-unknown-linux-musl)
make build-lambda-aws

# Build for local macOS
make build-lambda-local

# Build specific service
./scripts/build-lambda.sh [x86_64|arm64] [all|service-name]
```

### Deployment
```bash
# Deploy all layers to LocalStack
./infrastructure/scripts/init-environment.sh local

# Deploy all layers to AWS dev
./infrastructure/scripts/init-environment.sh dev

# Deploy single layer
./infrastructure/scripts/deploy-layer.sh <layer> <environment> [-auto-approve]
```

