EcoScan/
├── services/                     # Rust Lambda services
│   ├── bin-status-reporter/     # ✅ SQS-triggered status processor
│   ├── lambda-authorizer/       # ✅ JWT token validator
│   ├── admin-dashboard-api/     # ✅ Admin CRUD API
│   ├── e2e-tests/              # ✅ End-to-end tests
│   ├── notifier/               # ❌ STUB - Future notification service
│   └── shared/                 # ❌ STUB - Shared domain models
├── infrastructure/             # Terraform IaC
│   ├── layers/                 # Multi-layer architecture
│   ├── environments/           # Environment configs
│   └── scripts/                # Deployment scripts
├── scripts/                    # Build and utility scripts
└── docs/                       # Documentation
```

### Key Commands
```bash
make local-up          # Start LocalStack and deploy
make test              # Run all tests
make test-e2e          # Run E2E tests
make build             # Build Lambda function
make reset-local       # Tear down local environment
make lint              # Run linting
make fix               # Auto-fix linting issues
```

